add descriptions to neovim binds
ensure all shadows neovim binds get alt bind, e.g., i_CTRL-K

neovim bind ideas

ctrl-enter -> open action menu, e.g., like ctrl-enter in opencode
<Leader><Leader> as a "ctrl-shift" kind of overload for less common actions

neovim keys to consider remapping

Z - backspace in normal mode - almost always use something else to delete stuff in normal mode

H & L - top / bottom of screen - rarely useful, prime home row keys

: - will remap to register-replace

m & M - will remap to "move"

- need to find an alt bind for setting marks

neovim stuff

- crtl-h needs to be <BS> in picker / fzf
- plugin to run rg on project and show hits in quickfix
- project wide find/replace (or on all open files, or folder).
- nvim cannot have any alt binds. snacks explorer has them by default but they need to be remapped. will need to check any plugins for alt binds and remap

# mini.nvim

x = done and fully setup
y = yes, will use
n = no can't or won't use

- [y] mini.ai            Extend and create a/i textobjects
- [y] mini.align         Align text interactively
- [x] mini.comment       Comment lines
- [y] mini.completion    Completion and signature help
- [y] mini.keymap        Special key mappings
- [y] mini.move          Move any selection in any direction
- [y] mini.operators     Text edit operators
- [y] mini.pairs         Autopairs
- [y] mini.snippets      Manage and expand snippets
- [y] mini.splitjoin     Split and join arguments
- [y] mini.surround      Surround actions
- [y] mini.basics        Common configuration presets
- [y] mini.bracketed     Go forward/backward with square brackets
- [y] mini.bufremove     Remove buffers
- [n] mini.clue          Show next key clues
- [y] mini.cmdline       Command line tweaks
- [n] mini.deps          Plugin manager
- [?] mini.diff          Work with diff hunks
- [y] mini.extra         Extra ‘mini.nvim’ functionality
- [n] mini.files         Navigate and manipulate file system
- [?] mini.git           Git integration
- [n] mini.jump          Jump to next/previous single character
- [n] mini.jump2d        Jump within visible lines
  - [ ] => use flash.nvim
- [n] mini.misc          Miscellaneous functions
- [n] mini.pick          Pick anything
- [y] mini.sessions      Session management
- [?] mini.visits        Track and reuse file system visits
- [n] mini.animate       Animate common Neovim actions
- [?] mini.base16        Base16 colorscheme creation
- [n] mini.colors        Tweak and save any color scheme
- [n] mini.cursorword    Autohighlight word under cursor
- [n] mini.hipatterns    Highlight patterns in text
- [n] mini.hues          Generate configurable color scheme
- [y] mini.icons         Icon provider
- [y] mini.indentscope   Visualize and work with indent scope
- [n] mini.map           Window with buffer text overview
- [n] mini.notify        Show notifications
